<DocsExample TExample="AreaFilledExample" Title="Filled area" Description="An area series fills the space under the line. Use it for a single measure where the volume, not only the trend, matters. AreaOpacity sets how strongly the fill shows." />
<DocsExample TExample="AreaStackedExample" Title="Stacked areas" Description="Areas don't stack on their own: give each series the running total and draw the largest total first. Use it to show how parts add up to a whole over time; the tooltip then reports running totals." />
